AiTask weekly_category_revenue_email {
  label: 'Weekly Category Revenue Email'
  description: 'Emails last week’s revenue by product category with a chart attachment.'

  brief: @md
    1. From @Dataset:ecommerce_official, query fresh revenue by product category for last week, defined as the last complete Monday–Sunday week.
    2. Create a table that includes every available product category and its revenue, ranked from highest to lowest.
    3. Create a chart of revenue by product category for the same reporting period.
    4. Email the table to nhi.ty@holistics.io after every run, with the chart attached.
  ;;

  acceptance_criteria: @md
    - Uses a fresh query against @Dataset:ecommerce_official and covers exactly the last complete Monday–Sunday week.
    - Emails a table containing every available product category and its revenue, ranked from highest to lowest.
    - Includes a chart of revenue by product category for the same reporting period as an email attachment.
    - Sends the completed email to nhi.ty@holistics.io after every run.
  ;;
}
